                  "content": "Time-trial riders reduce their profile to move through resistance. Wind-tunnel diagrams make that invisible force visible. Here, the same low tuck turns a laptop typist into a symbol of effortless momentum.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
