                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "F2XBM",
                      "name": "Rationale",
                      "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Slipstream is the scene: a person tucked flat in the wake of an agent that takes the wind for them. Held inside the chamber it reads as brand imagery; lifted out, the two silhouettes alone become the mark — and the agent is the part you can drop.",
