                          "name": "Conclusion",
                          "fill": "$brand-ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "1.  The tuck is retained in every candidate; a flat back removes two-fifths of the measured drag.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 11.5,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "yycuB",
                          "name": "Conclusion",
                          "fill": "$brand-ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "2.  The agent belongs upstream, not abreast. Alongside it adds frontal area and fuses at small scale.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 11.5,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "Kpqat",
                          "name": "Conclusion",
                          "fill": "$brand-ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "3.  Model A-4 is recommended as the primary mark; A-2 stands where the agent cannot be read.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 11.5,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
