                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Solid shapes, one scale, one posture. Learn the outline before the detail: in the field the mark arrives as a shape at distance, and only the tuck survives the reduction. Figures 1–8 are the primary mark, Operator aerodynamicus tuckus, alone and in company with Agens ducens.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
