                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Four configurations are recorded again and again as the tucked operator. None of them is. Each is separated from the true species by a single feature; that feature is indicated. All specimens are drawn to one scale, at one posture, facing right.",
