                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1180,
                  "content": "A mark is disclosed in which an operator is held in a tucked attitude in the wake of a leading agent. Filed as a specification because a specification is the one document that must say exactly what is claimed and what is merely shown — solid line for the invention, outline for the environment. Six sheets. Six claims. One independent.",
