                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1180,
                  "content": "REFERENCE NUMERALS, USED IDENTICALLY ON EVERY SHEET\n10 the mark   12 operator, tucked   14 back, flat   16 head, carried low   18 deck\n20 hands   22 agent, leading   24 wake   26 gap, one body length   28 wordmark   30 ground line   32 flow indicia",
