                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "gBhxw",
                      "name": "Abstract paragraph",
                      "fill": "$brand-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "[0001]  The ornamental design for an aerodynamic mark for an agentic workspace, as shown and described. Said mark 10 comprises an operator 12 disposed in a tucked posture, wherein a back 14 is carried substantially flat and a head 16 is carried low and forward of the shoulder line, said operator 12 being engaged with a deck 18 by way of hands 20 held in sustained contact therewith. An agent 22 is disposed forward of said operator 12 in a leading position and is separated therefrom by a gap 26 of approximately one body length, whereby a wake 24 generated by said agent 22 is received by said operator 12 and the aggregate drag of the pair is thereby reduced below that of either constituent figure travelling alone. A wordmark 28 and a ground line 30 are disposed beneath said figures and are shown in broken outline. Flow indicia 32 disposed within said gap 26 indicate the direction of travel and form no part of the claimed design.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.62,
                      "textAlign": "justify",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 10.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
