                      "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Referring now to FIG. 1, the mark (10) is shown in side elevation, wherein the operator (12) is disposed within the wake (24) of the leading agent (22) at a gap (26) of substantially one body length. Said operator (12), back (14), head (16), deck (18), hands (20), and wordmark (28), rendered in solid fill, constitute the claimed design. Matter rendered in outline only — said agent (22), wake (24), gap (26), ground line (30), and flow indicia (32) — is disclosed to show the environment in which the mark is used and forms no part of the claimed design.",
