                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "PL8a0",
                              "name": "FIELD OF THE INVENTION",
                              "fill": "$brand-moss",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "FIELD OF THE INVENTION",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "textAlign": "center",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                              "fontSize": 8,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "letterSpacing": 0.9
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "G8unh7",
                              "name": "[0001]",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 6,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "BuDq6",
                                  "name": "No",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 34,
                                  "content": "[0001]",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 8,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "nFN3s",
                                  "name": "Body",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "The present invention relates to ornamental designs for graphic marks, and more particularly to an aerodynamic mark (10) for an agentic workspace, in which a human operator (12) is shown tucked into the wake (24) of a leading agent (22).",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                  "textAlign": "justify",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "sxhqO",
                              "name": "BACKGROUND OF THE INVENTION",
                              "fill": "$brand-moss",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "BACKGROUND OF THE INVENTION",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "textAlign": "center",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                              "fontSize": 8,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "letterSpacing": 0.9
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "ldSnV",
                              "name": "[0002]",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 6,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "sknDu",
                                  "name": "No",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 34,
                                  "content": "[0002]",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 8,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "U1uB5w",
                                  "name": "Body",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Marks of the prior art are, almost without exception, set upright. An upright figure presents its whole frontal area to the reader, and must therefore displace the entire volume of attention standing in front of it. That cost is paid at every impression, while the return does not scale with it. Such a mark is, in the plain sense of the word, draggy. A mark ought to be judged as a body in a stream is judged: by the attention it costs measured against the work it returns.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                  "textAlign": "justify",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "HTLRU",
                              "name": "[0003]",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 6,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "U8x6Wt",
                                  "name": "No",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 34,
                                  "content": "[0003]",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 8,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "OqEyF",
                                  "name": "Body",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "The deficiency is most acute at reduced scale. An upright mark carries its information in the vertical: the head held high, the limbs held clear of the body, a silhouette distributed across a tall and narrow envelope. Reduced to the size of a favicon that envelope collapses upon itself, the interior detail closes, and the mark is lost entirely. What remains at that size is a smudge of ink in the shape of nothing in particular, and the impression is wasted.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                  "textAlign": "justify",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "HBiOY",
                              "name": "[0004]",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 6,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "M8AFB1",
                                  "name": "No",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 34,
                                  "content": "[0004]",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 8,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "bUFFi",
                                  "name": "Body",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Prior marks have failed for this reason and no other. Marks setting two figures abreast double the frontal area rather than halve it, and at small sizes the two figures merge into a single unreadable mass. Marks lowering the figure without tucking it merely shorten the mark without reducing what it presents. In each case the upright posture, and not the number of figures, is the source of the loss, and no amount of simplification within that posture has been found to recover it.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                  "textAlign": "justify",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "srsbc",
                              "name": "SUMMARY OF THE INVENTION",
                              "fill": "$brand-moss",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "SUMMARY OF THE INVENTION",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "textAlign": "center",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                              "fontSize": 8,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "letterSpacing": 0.9
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "EXwzh",
                              "name": "[0005]",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 6,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "Du3u1",
                                  "name": "No",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 34,
                                  "content": "[0005]",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 8,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "BtShy",
                                  "name": "Body",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "The present design overcomes the foregoing by tucking the operator (12) and placing it in the wake (24) of the leading agent (22). The back (14) is held flat, the head (16) is carried low and forward of the shoulder, the hands (20) are closed upon the deck (18), and the whole of the operator is drawn down into a long horizontal envelope.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                  "textAlign": "justify",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "LYnfL",
                              "name": "[0006]",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "gap": 6,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "VwB4Q",
                                  "name": "No",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 34,
                                  "content": "[0006]",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 8,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "v1TOMh",
                                  "name": "Body",
                                  "fill": "$brand-ink",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "The agent (22) leads by a gap (26) of one body length. The operator is thereby shown to be carried rather than to be racing, and the two figures read as one system and not as two competitors. The deck (18) is carried level, the hands (20) remain within the silhouette, and the wake (24) is drawn as a shallow horizontal trail closing the interval between the two figures.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                  "textAlign": "justify",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
