                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rSmlL",
                  "name": "Intro",
                  "fill": "$brand-ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A paceline is not an order of rank. The rider at the front is spending every watt they have so that the rider behind spends barely seven in ten, and in forty seconds they will trade places. Every diagram below is the same two bodies at the same gap; only the sequence changes. This is the plate that keeps the mark honest — it shows the instant the mark depicts, and the three instants either side of it.",
